        "title": "What Exists (3 files, ~505 lines)",
        "content": "\n| File | What's Covered |\n|------|---------------|\n| `execute.test.ts` | Auth guard, model allowlist, operator blocklist, `take` clamping |\n| `policies.test.ts` | ZenStack access rules for 8 feature areas (tenant isolation, groups, polls, chat, notifications, calendar, attachments, calls) |\n| `user-admin-fields.test.ts` | Field-level deny on `role`, `banned`, `banReason`, `email`, `permissions` |\n\n---\n\n",
